This design pattern lets devide the related hierarchies which are closely related into separate hierarchy.
This separate the abstraction and implemenatation which can be developed separate
One class will have reference to another class and which will delegates work related to that reference

Abstraction is high level control (how) and implemenation layer is responsible for actual work
Lets say we wanted to send Notification and Reminder both 
Here if we combine class inheritance then there will be combinatione liek below
  - NotificationViaSMS
  - NotificationViaEmail
  - ReminderViaSMS
  - ReminderViaEmail

but if we separate SMS Sender and Notification sender separet then we can avoid this exponeantiol growing intertance

Abstraction  (what)                 Implemenatation (how)
    |                                      |
Notification                         MessageSender
    |                                      |
AlertNotification                    SMSSender
ReminderNotification                 EMailSender